### What are the documented life dates and biographical details of the historical person Amelia Bassano, if she existed?
Answer: Based on the provided WikiTree source, the documented life dates and details for Amelia (or Emilia) Bassano are: she was baptized on 27 January 1568/9 in London, married musician Alfonso Lanier in 1592, had a son Henry and a daughter Odillia (who died in infancy), and was buried on 3 April 1645.

Source URL: https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bassano-7

